SUMMARY:How did you come to join the service? Where were you living\, and w
 hat were you doing when it was decided?
DESCRIPTION:Day 1 of 30\, 30 days with a veteran.\n\nAsk: How did you come 
 to join the service? Where were you living\, and what were you doing when 
 it was decided?\n\nThen: Who did you tell first\, and how did they take it
 ?\n\nTip: Let them lead. Skip anything they do not want to go into. This q
 uestion starts before any of the hard parts\, on purpose.\n\nLet them lead
 . Skip anything they do not want to go into\, and believe them the first t
 ime they say so.\n\nAll thirty questions\, printable: https://question-a-d
 ay.example/print/veteran.html\n\nFrom PureTome. No sign-up\, nothing to un
 subscribe from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://question-a-day.example/print/veteran.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
CLASS:PUBLIC
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Today's question: How did you come to join the service? Where w
 ere you living\, and what were you doing when it was decided?
TRIGGER;RELATED=START:PT9H
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:puretome-question-a-day-veteran-20270612-d02-sub
DTSTAMP:20261116T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270613
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270614
SUMMARY:Tell me about the day you left for training. How did you get there?
DESCRIPTION:Day 2 of 30\, 30 days with a veteran.\n\nAsk: Tell me about the
  day you left for training. How did you get there?\n\nThen: What did you b
 ring with you?\n\nTip: Travel stories warm people up. Ask who was sitting 
 next to them.\n\nAll thirty questions\, printable: https://question-a-day.
 example/print/veteran.html\n\nFrom PureTome. No sign-up\, nothing to unsub
 scribe from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://question-a-day.example/print/veteran.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
CLASS:PUBLIC
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Today's question: Tell me about the day you left for training. 
 How did you get there?
TRIGGER;RELATED=START:PT9H
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:puretome-question-a-day-veteran-20270612-d03-sub
DTSTAMP:20261116T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270614
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270615
SUMMARY:What do you remember about your first few days of training? Pick on
 e moment.
DESCRIPTION:Day 3 of 30\, 30 days with a veteran.\n\nAsk: What do you remem
 ber about your first few days of training? Pick one moment.\n\nThen: Who w
 as the first person you got to know there?\n\nTip: Training is often where
  the funny stories live. Let them laugh.\n\nAll thirty questions\, printab
 le: https://question-a-day.example/print/veteran.html\n\nFrom PureTome. No
  sign-up\, nothing to unsubscribe from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://question-a-day.example/print/veteran.html
