BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Today's question: What do you remember about your first few day
 s of training? Pick one moment.
TRIGGER;RELATED=START:PT9H
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:puretome-question-a-day-veteran-20270612-d04-sub
DTSTAMP:20261116T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270615
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270616
SUMMARY:Who was in charge of you in training that you still remember? What 
 did they look and sound like?
DESCRIPTION:Day 4 of 30\, 30 days with a veteran.\n\nAsk: Who was in charge
  of you in training that you still remember? What did they look and sound 
 like?\n\nThen: What is something they said that stayed with you?\n\nTip: A
 sk for the voice. People often remember exactly how an instructor said som
 ething.\n\nAll thirty questions\, printable: https://question-a-day.exampl
 e/print/veteran.html\n\nFrom PureTome. No sign-up\, nothing to unsubscribe
  from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://question-a-day.example/print/veteran.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
CLASS:PUBLIC
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Today's question: Who was in charge of you in training that you
  still remember? What did they look and sound like?
TRIGGER;RELATED=START:PT9H
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:puretome-question-a-day-veteran-20270612-d05-sub
DTSTAMP:20261116T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270616
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270617
SUMMARY:Once training was over\, what did a normal day look like? Take me f
 rom waking up to lights out.
DESCRIPTION:Day 5 of 30\, 30 days with a veteran.\n\nAsk: Once training was
  over\, what did a normal day look like? Take me from waking up to lights 
 out.\n\nThen: What was the food like?\n\nTip: Ordinary days are safer grou
 nd than big ones\, and they are the part nobody else will remember.\n\nAll
  thirty questions\, printable: https://question-a-day.example/print/vetera
 n.html\n\nFrom PureTome. No sign-up\, nothing to unsubscribe from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://question-a-day.example/print/veteran.html
