DESCRIPTION:Today's question: Once training was over\, what did a normal da
 y look like? Take me from waking up to lights out.
TRIGGER;RELATED=START:PT9H
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:puretome-question-a-day-veteran-20270612-d06-sub
DTSTAMP:20261116T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270617
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270618
SUMMARY:Who did you share quarters with? Tell me about one of them.
DESCRIPTION:Day 6 of 30\, 30 days with a veteran.\n\nAsk: Who did you share
  quarters with? Tell me about one of them.\n\nThen: Where were they from\,
  and what were they like?\n\nTip: Write every name down. Names are threads
  you can come back to.\n\nAll thirty questions\, printable: https://questi
 on-a-day.example/print/veteran.html\n\nFrom PureTome. No sign-up\, nothing
  to unsubscribe from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://question-a-day.example/print/veteran.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
CLASS:PUBLIC
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Today's question: Who did you share quarters with? Tell me abou
 t one of them.
TRIGGER;RELATED=START:PT9H
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:puretome-question-a-day-veteran-20270612-d07-sub
DTSTAMP:20261116T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270618
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270619
SUMMARY:What did you keep with you\, in a pocket or a bag\, that you cared 
 about?
DESCRIPTION:Day 7 of 30\, 30 days with a veteran.\n\nAsk: What did you keep
  with you\, in a pocket or a bag\, that you cared about?\n\nThen: Where is
  it now?\n\nTip: If they still have it\, ask them to bring it out. Objects
  make it easier to talk.\n\nAll thirty questions\, printable: https://ques
 tion-a-day.example/print/veteran.html\n\nFrom PureTome. No sign-up\, nothi
 ng to unsubscribe from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://question-a-day.example/print/veteran.html
