TRIGGER;RELATED=START:PT9H
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:puretome-question-a-day-veteran-20270612-d08-sub
DTSTAMP:20261116T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270619
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270620
SUMMARY:Tell me about a letter\, call or package from home that you remembe
 r.
DESCRIPTION:Day 8 of 30\, 30 days with a veteran.\n\nAsk: Tell me about a l
 etter\, call or package from home that you remember.\n\nThen: Who wrote to
  you most often?\n\nTip: If letters survive in a drawer\, ask before readi
 ng any\, and let them choose which ones.\n\nAll thirty questions\, printab
 le: https://question-a-day.example/print/veteran.html\n\nFrom PureTome. No
  sign-up\, nothing to unsubscribe from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://question-a-day.example/print/veteran.html
