UID:puretome-question-a-day-veteran-20270612-d09-sub
DTSTAMP:20261116T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270620
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270621
SUMMARY:What is a place where you served that you can still picture? Descri
 be it.
DESCRIPTION:Day 9 of 30\, 30 days with a veteran.\n\nAsk: What is a place w
 here you served that you can still picture? Describe it.\n\nThen: What was
  the weather like\, and what did it smell like?\n\nTip: Let them pick the 
 place. They may skip some\, and that is their choice.\n\nAll thirty questi
 ons\, printable: https://question-a-day.example/print/veteran.html\n\nFrom
  PureTome. No sign-up\, nothing to unsubscribe from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://question-a-day.example/print/veteran.html
