DTSTAMP:20261116T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270621
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270622
SUMMARY:Tell me about one day off that you remember. Where did you go?
DESCRIPTION:Day 10 of 30\, 30 days with a veteran.\n\nAsk: Tell me about on
 e day off that you remember. Where did you go?\n\nThen: Who were you with?
 \n\nTip: Days off are where the friendships show.\n\nAll thirty questions\
 , printable: https://question-a-day.example/print/veteran.html\n\nFrom Pur
 eTome. No sign-up\, nothing to unsubscribe from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://question-a-day.example/print/veteran.html
