DTSTAMP:20261116T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270622
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270623
SUMMARY:What was your job day to day? Show me with your hands if it helps.
DESCRIPTION:Day 11 of 30\, 30 days with a veteran.\n\nAsk: What was your jo
 b day to day? Show me with your hands if it helps.\n\nThen: What part of i
 t were you good at?\n\nTip: Asking what they were good at puts them in the
  expert's chair.\n\nAll thirty questions\, printable: https://question-a-d
 ay.example/print/veteran.html\n\nFrom PureTome. No sign-up\, nothing to un
 subscribe from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://question-a-day.example/print/veteran.html
