DTSTAMP:20261116T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270623
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270624
SUMMARY:Who do you still think about from your time in service? Tell me abo
 ut them.
DESCRIPTION:Day 12 of 30\, 30 days with a veteran.\n\nAsk: Who do you still
  think about from your time in service? Tell me about them.\n\nThen: What 
 would you say to them if they walked in?\n\nTip: This one can bring a long
  pause. Do not fill it. Count to ten in your head.\n\nAll thirty questions
 \, printable: https://question-a-day.example/print/veteran.html\n\nFrom Pu
 reTome. No sign-up\, nothing to unsubscribe from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://question-a-day.example/print/veteran.html
