UID:puretome-question-a-day-veteran-20270612-d13-sub
DTSTAMP:20261116T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270624
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270625
SUMMARY:What is the funniest thing you remember from your time in service?
DESCRIPTION:Day 13 of 30\, 30 days with a veteran.\n\nAsk: What is the funn
 iest thing you remember from your time in service?\n\nThen: Who was in on 
 it?\n\nTip: Funny stories are a way in. More serious ones may come later\,
  in their own time\, or not at all.\n\nAll thirty questions\, printable: h
 ttps://question-a-day.example/print/veteran.html\n\nFrom PureTome. No sign
 -up\, nothing to unsubscribe from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://question-a-day.example/print/veteran.html
