UID:puretome-question-a-day-veteran-20270612-d14-sub
DTSTAMP:20261116T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270625
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270626
SUMMARY:Tell me about a person you met in the service who was nothing like 
 the people back home.
DESCRIPTION:Day 14 of 30\, 30 days with a veteran.\n\nAsk: Tell me about a 
 person you met in the service who was nothing like the people back home.\n
 \nThen: What did you learn from them?\n\nTip: People from somewhere else o
 ften explain a whole period of someone's life.\n\nAll thirty questions\, p
 rintable: https://question-a-day.example/print/veteran.html\n\nFrom PureTo
 me. No sign-up\, nothing to unsubscribe from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://question-a-day.example/print/veteran.html
