DTSTAMP:20261116T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270626
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270627
SUMMARY:Tell me about a holiday you spent in the service. Where were you?
DESCRIPTION:Day 15 of 30\, 30 days with a veteran.\n\nAsk: Tell me about a 
 holiday you spent in the service. Where were you?\n\nThen: What did people
  do to make it feel like a holiday?\n\nTip: Around any holiday\, this is a
  gentle question for the table.\n\nAll thirty questions\, printable: https
 ://question-a-day.example/print/veteran.html\n\nFrom PureTome. No sign-up\
 , nothing to unsubscribe from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://question-a-day.example/print/veteran.html
