UID:puretome-question-a-day-veteran-20270612-d16-sub
DTSTAMP:20261116T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270627
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270628
SUMMARY:What was the hardest part of being away? Answer as much or as littl
 e as you like.
DESCRIPTION:Day 16 of 30\, 30 days with a veteran.\n\nAsk: What was the har
 dest part of being away? Answer as much or as little as you like.\n\nThen:
  What helped?\n\nTip: A good day to remind them they can skip anything. "T
 hat's fine" is all you need to say.\n\nAll thirty questions\, printable: h
 ttps://question-a-day.example/print/veteran.html\n\nFrom PureTome. No sign
 -up\, nothing to unsubscribe from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://question-a-day.example/print/veteran.html
