UID:puretome-question-a-day-veteran-20270612-d17-sub
DTSTAMP:20261116T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270628
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270629
SUMMARY:What do people who were not there tend to get wrong about it? Where
  did you first notice?
DESCRIPTION:Day 17 of 30\, 30 days with a veteran.\n\nAsk: What do people w
 ho were not there tend to get wrong about it? Where did you first notice?\
 n\nThen: What would you want them to understand instead?\n\nTip: People wh
 o will not talk about themselves will often happily correct a movie.\n\nAl
 l thirty questions\, printable: https://question-a-day.example/print/veter
 an.html\n\nFrom PureTome. No sign-up\, nothing to unsubscribe from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://question-a-day.example/print/veteran.html
