DTSTAMP:20261116T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270629
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270630
SUMMARY:Tell me about the day you found out you were going home\, or gettin
 g out.
DESCRIPTION:Day 18 of 30\, 30 days with a veteran.\n\nAsk: Tell me about th
 e day you found out you were going home\, or getting out.\n\nThen: What di
 d you do first?\n\nTip: Let them tell it in order. Do not jump ahead to ho
 w they felt.\n\nAll thirty questions\, printable: https://question-a-day.e
 xample/print/veteran.html\n\nFrom PureTome. No sign-up\, nothing to unsubs
 cribe from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://question-a-day.example/print/veteran.html
