DTSTAMP:20261116T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270630
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270701
SUMMARY:What was coming home like? Tell me about the first day or the first
  week.
DESCRIPTION:Day 19 of 30\, 30 days with a veteran.\n\nAsk: What was coming 
 home like? Tell me about the first day or the first week.\n\nThen: Who did
  you see first?\n\nTip: Many veterans say nobody ever asked about this par
 t. Take your time with it.\n\nAll thirty questions\, printable: https://qu
 estion-a-day.example/print/veteran.html\n\nFrom PureTome. No sign-up\, not
 hing to unsubscribe from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://question-a-day.example/print/veteran.html
