UID:puretome-question-a-day-veteran-20270612-d20-sub
DTSTAMP:20261116T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270701
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270702
SUMMARY:What did you do for work after you got out\, and how did you find t
 hat first job?
DESCRIPTION:Day 20 of 30\, 30 days with a veteran.\n\nAsk: What did you do 
 for work after you got out\, and how did you find that first job?\n\nThen:
  What from the service did you bring to it?\n\nTip: This connects the serv
 ice years to the rest of their life. Ask about the bridge between them.\n\
 nAll thirty questions\, printable: https://question-a-day.example/print/ve
 teran.html\n\nFrom PureTome. No sign-up\, nothing to unsubscribe from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://question-a-day.example/print/veteran.html
