UID:puretome-question-a-day-veteran-20270612-d21-sub
DTSTAMP:20261116T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270702
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270703
SUMMARY:Who from your service did you see again years later? Tell me about 
 that day.
DESCRIPTION:Day 21 of 30\, 30 days with a veteran.\n\nAsk: Who from your se
 rvice did you see again years later? Tell me about that day.\n\nThen: Who 
 did you lose touch with that you still wonder about?\n\nTip: If a call or 
 a letter still seems possible\, write the name down.\n\nAll thirty questio
 ns\, printable: https://question-a-day.example/print/veteran.html\n\nFrom 
 PureTome. No sign-up\, nothing to unsubscribe from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://question-a-day.example/print/veteran.html
