DTSTAMP:20261116T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270703
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270704
SUMMARY:What did you keep from your service: papers\, photographs\, anythin
 g at all? Tell me the story behind one thing.
DESCRIPTION:Day 22 of 30\, 30 days with a veteran.\n\nAsk: What did you kee
 p from your service: papers\, photographs\, anything at all? Tell me the s
 tory behind one thing.\n\nThen: Who else has seen it?\n\nTip: Ask before h
 andling anything. Let them hold it while they talk.\n\nAll thirty question
 s\, printable: https://question-a-day.example/print/veteran.html\n\nFrom P
 ureTome. No sign-up\, nothing to unsubscribe from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://question-a-day.example/print/veteran.html
