DTSTAMP:20261116T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270704
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270705
SUMMARY:Tell me about a conversation with your family about your service th
 at you remember.
DESCRIPTION:Day 23 of 30\, 30 days with a veteran.\n\nAsk: Tell me about a 
 conversation with your family about your service that you remember.\n\nThe
 n: What did you want them to understand?\n\nTip: If you were part of that 
 conversation\, let them tell it their way first.\n\nAll thirty questions\,
  printable: https://question-a-day.example/print/veteran.html\n\nFrom Pure
 Tome. No sign-up\, nothing to unsubscribe from.
