SUMMARY:What do you want the family to remember about your service? Tell me
  the story you would want told.
DESCRIPTION:Day 30 of 30\, 30 days with a veteran.\n\nAsk: What do you want
  the family to remember about your service? Tell me the story you would wa
 nt told.\n\nThen: What would you rather we kept to ourselves?\n\nTip: Read
  back what you wrote and ask if you got it right. If they would like their
  story kept for good\, the Library of Congress Veterans History Project co
 llects interviews from families.\n\nAll thirty questions\, printable: http
 s://question-a-day.example/print/veteran.html\n\nFrom PureTome. No sign-up
